5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's be smart about this. I want to see the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll focus on the human element. I'm looking into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm interested in the passenger experience. I'll take the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the hidden hurdles. I will look at the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll examine the finances. I'll take the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
