20,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
21,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
22,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
23,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,May,,"It seems some old ideas actually worked. One pilot was technically sound, and another met its cost targets.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We have a problem. The late-turn pool is thin, and we're relying heavily on overtime for both departures and maintenance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Interestingly, the delays aren't where we think. It's the connections that cost time, not the actual travel or the ticketing machines.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I've found that pre-war shells are risky due to unrecorded voids, and the ferry and rail offices haven't agreed on data terms.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The budget is tight. Operating subsidies are trimmed, and ticketing fees are now costing us more than our road resurfacing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the rosters are that thin, any plan requiring more late-night staff will be a struggle, won't it?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Exactly. We are below establishment for roadway crews, though the lift maintenance contract actually has some spare capacity.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, if ticketing fees are so high, perhaps a system overhaul is financially prudent?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, but remember the joint operators' committee minutes; getting the ferry and rail offices to agree on data is a nightmare.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,Shizue makes a good point. A technical fix is only as good as the agreement behind it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shizue, what about the accessibility records? I saw some lane-priority stretches were returned to mixed traffic.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If the lift maintenance has capacity, maybe station upgrades are more feasible than new bus lanes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Midori,,"But the mid-city runs are taking longer than they did a decade ago, even if the crowds are clearing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The ""ground"" is the problem. Those pre-war shells are unpredictable. Any station work will likely hit delays.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,We have a ring-fenced construction balance from a lapsed grant. We should use it before it's gone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,May,,We need something that won't just stall like the previous lane-priority projects.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'm wary of anything that adds pressure to the overnight gangs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Midori,,"If the issue is connection time, we need to look at the flow, not just the speed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I prefer a path of least resistance regarding approvals and physical surprises.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I just want a plan that doesn't create a long-term financial drain we can't afford.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,3,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
46,3,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
